  - rgpot
  - capnproto
  - ctypes
abstract: >-
  cpmdc is the C ABI layer for embedding OpenCPMD
  (https://github.com/OpenCPMD/CPMD) in OmniPotentRPC tools.
  It gives non-Fortran callers one stable boundary for CPMD setup,
  geometry steps, feature discovery, and result messages.
